    <briefdescription>
<para>Relinkable handle to an observable. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An instance of this class can be relinked so that it points to another observable. The change will be propagated to all handles that were created as copies of such instance.</para><para><simplesect kind="pre"><para>Class T must inherit from <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_observable" kindref="compound">Observable</ref></para></simplesect>
<xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000028"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>see the <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_handle" kindref="compound">Handle</ref> documentation for issues relatives to <computeroutput>registerAsObserver</computeroutput>. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
